  'C:\\Users\\lucar\\.lmstudio\\.internal\\temp\\lmstudio-chat-template-XXXXXX'
```

Stopping the server removes `~/.lmstudio/.internal/temp`; the next server never
recreates it, so **every chat-model load fails** while the server reports itself
healthy. The launch of record is now `tools/lmstudio_start.py`: recreate the
directory, start the server, wait for `/v1/models`, optionally `--load`, exit 0
only when the API answers.

